Use Case 2:
Demonstrate dynamic inference, dynamic typing using with fee by applying .18 gst  and prove strongly typing character also by operating it with Eighteen percent gst

fee = 45000

Sol:
====
# Dynamic inference
fee = 45000
print(type(fee))
gst = 0.18
print(type(gst))


# Dynamic typing
fee = 45000
print(type(fee))
fee = fee * 0.18
print(type(fee))


#strongly typed
fee = 'Hundred'
gst = 0.18
print(fee + gst)


